{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05772","headline":"送綦毋潜 · 卢象","name":"送綦毋潜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫君不得意，本自沧海来。\n高足未云骋，虚舟空复回。\n淮南枫叶落，灞岸桃花开。\n出处暂爲耳，沈浮安系哉。\n如何天覆物，还遣世遗才。\n欲识秦将汉，尝闻王与裴。\n离筵对寒食，别雨乘春雷。\n会有徵书到，荷衣且漫裁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}